WEBVTT

00:00:00.180 --> 00:00:01.095 line:86%
Hey everyone,

00:00:01.135 --> 00:00:03.374 line:86%
in this video I'll show you how

00:00:03.414 --> 00:00:04.590 line:86%
to create mirror

00:00:04.640 --> 00:00:06.072 line:86%
reflections inside Vizai,

00:00:06.112 --> 00:00:07.838 line:86%
and also how to add fake light

00:00:07.878 --> 00:00:08.820 line:86%
to your project.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:11.435 line:86%
First step is to set up and save

00:00:11.475 --> 00:00:12.622 line:86%
all your scenes.

00:00:12.662 --> 00:00:14.319 line:86%
Always save them first,

00:00:14.359 --> 00:00:16.043 line:86%
because each reflection

00:00:16.083 --> 00:00:18.145 line:86%
is stored inside the scene,

00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:18.950 line:86%
so you can

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:20.149 line:86%
switch between them and change

00:00:20.189 --> 00:00:21.578 line:86%
the reflections together.

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:47.390 line:86%
With the first reflection done,

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.660 line:86%
move on to the next scene and repeat

00:00:49.710 --> 00:00:50.910 line:86%
the same process.

00:00:58.410 --> 00:01:01.149 line:86%
A tip: whenever there are two faces

00:01:01.189 --> 00:01:02.012 line:86%
to select,

00:01:02.052 --> 00:01:02.880 line:86%
hold Shift

00:01:02.930 --> 00:01:04.122 line:86%
on your keyboard,

00:01:04.162 --> 00:01:06.190 line:86%
then press Enter to confirm.

00:01:06.330 --> 00:01:08.374 line:86%
And whenever you are unsure how

00:01:08.414 --> 00:01:09.315 line:86%
to use a tool,

00:01:09.355 --> 00:01:10.700 line:86%
just read the orange

00:01:10.750 --> 00:01:12.630 line:86%
field in the plugin.

00:01:53.330 --> 00:01:54.350 line:86%
As you can see,

00:01:54.390 --> 00:01:56.293 line:86%
you can also add reflections

00:01:56.333 --> 00:01:57.241 line:86%
to some types

00:01:57.281 --> 00:01:58.507 line:86%
of glass: bronze,

00:01:58.547 --> 00:02:00.310 line:86%
tinted and plain glass.

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.751 line:86%
Creating fake light is very simple:

00:02:43.791 --> 00:02:45.690 line:86%
just pick the LED strip and

00:02:45.740 --> 00:02:48.740 line:86%
choose a line where it will be placed.

00:02:53.200 --> 00:02:55.241 line:86%
With these sliders you adjust

00:02:55.281 --> 00:02:57.071 line:86%
the intensity and the size

00:02:57.111 --> 00:02:58.080 line:86%
of the strip.

00:04:07.040 --> 00:04:08.448 line:86%
One important tip:

00:04:08.488 --> 00:04:10.424 line:86%
always paint yellow where

00:04:10.464 --> 00:04:12.830 line:86%
the ceiling light will be, so

00:04:12.880 --> 00:04:13.825 line:86%
the AI understands your lighting

00:04:13.865 --> 00:04:14.565 line:86%
better.

00:04:15.640 --> 00:04:17.296 line:86%
Now put all these tips into

00:04:17.336 --> 00:04:18.427 line:86%
practice in Vizai.

00:04:18.467 --> 00:04:20.100 line:86%
See you in the next video.

